  "exercises": [
    {
      "number": "624",
      "text": "624．把下列各式写成分式的形式：\na）$\\left(\\frac{x}{2y}\\right)^3$；\nb）$\\left(\\frac{3a}{c}\\right)^4$；\nc）$\\left(\\frac{-a}{3b}\\right)^3$；\nd）$\\left(-\\frac{m^2}{10q}\\right)^3$；\ne）$\\left(\\frac{10a^4}{3x^4}\\right)^4$；\nf）$\\left(-\\frac{x^5}{y^2}\\right)^4$；\ng）$\\left(\\frac{2}{-p^4q^3}\\right)^6$；\nh）$\\left(-\\frac{a^8b^0}{5c^6}\\right)^3$；\ni）$\\left(\\frac{2x^5}{0.2y^{10}}\\right)^5$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "625",
      "text": "625．化简：\na）$\\left(\\frac{a^3}{b^2}\\right)^3\\cdot\\left(\\frac{b^4}{a^2}\\right)^4$；\nb）$\\left(-\\frac{2x^4}{y^5}\\right)^4\\cdot\\left(\\frac{y^7}{4x^6}\\right)^3$；\nc）$\\left(-\\frac{3x^7}{a^{12}}\\right):\\left(-\\frac{9x^5}{a^8}\\right)^3$；\nd）$\\left(\\frac{8a^3}{9b^2}\\right)^3\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{27b^3}{16a^4}\\right)^2$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "627",
      "text": "627．求值：\na）$\\frac{4^3\\cdot3^{10}}{6^{10}}$；\nb）$\\frac{2^6\\cdot6^{18}}{2^{25}\\cdot9^9}$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "628",
      "text": "628．在点号处填上符号$=$，$>$或$<$，使所得到的命题是真命题：\na）$0.3^{16}\\ldots(-0.3)^{16}$；\nb）$(-1.9)^{21}\\ldots1.9^{21}$；\nc）$-5.6^4\\ldots(-5.6)^4$；\nd）$-0.8^{11}\\ldots(-0.8)^{11}$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "629",
      "text": "629．图108中总共有几个矩形？",
      "figure_ids": [
        "fig-108"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "concepts": [
    {
      "block": 1,
      "text": "一般地，如果$n$是自然数，那么当$a$和$b$取任意值（$b\\ne0$）时，下式等式是真等式：\n$\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)^n=\\frac{a^n}{b^n}$．分式的$n$次幂，等于分子的$n$次幂除以分母的$n$次幂．"
    }
  ],
